    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Somnum</strong>, a cooperative horror game where you and your friends are trapped in the same mysterious dream every night. To escape, you'll need to <strong>work together</strong>, solve puzzles, and gather energy while exploring eerie and surreal environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a <strong>unique ability</strong> and a <strong>personal drawback</strong> that affects progression. Teamwork, timing, and sharp thinking are essential if you hope to wake up\u2026 or risk being stuck in the dream forever.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>1 to 4 player co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles and team-based objectives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Unique levels</strong> like a floating city or a maze-like Japanese hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Time pressure and player-voted penalties</strong> between levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dream... or to face your nightmare.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Somnum</strong>, a cooperative horror game where you and your friends are trapped in the same mysterious dream every night. To escape, you'll need to <strong>work together</strong>, solve puzzles, and gather energy while exploring eerie and surreal environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a <strong>unique ability</strong> and a <strong>personal drawback</strong> that affects progression. Teamwork, timing, and sharp thinking are essential if you hope to wake up\u2026 or risk being stuck in the dream forever.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>1 to 4 player co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles and team-based objectives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Unique levels</strong> like a floating city or a maze-like Japanese hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Time pressure and player-voted penalties</strong> between levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dream... or to face your nightmare.</p>",
